<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-CZECHS WIN DOUBLES, TRAIL SWEDEN 2-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CZECHS WIN DOUBLES, TRAIL SWEDEN 2-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-09-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech Republic kept its hopes alive for advancing past Sweden in their Davis Cup World Group semifinal, winning the doubles match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Result:</p>
<p>Petr Korda/Daniel Vacek beat Jonas Bjorkman/Nicklas Kulti 4-6</p>
<p>6-3 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Sweden lead the Czech Republic 2-1</p>
</text>
